      "sub_pages_count": 0,
      "description_stripped": "Every TipTap node type in one page.",
      "created_at": "2026-09-01T10:00:00Z",
      "updated_at": "2026-10-01T10:00:00Z",
      "workspace": "cccccccc-0000-4000-8000-000000000001",
      "description_html": "<h2 class=\"editor-heading-block\" data-id=\"h1\">Characters that break MDX</h2><p class=\"editor-paragraph-block\">Braces {like.this} and a &lt;div&gt; tag, a&lt;b, an HTML comment &lt;!-- not a comment --&gt; and <span data-text-color=\"peach\" style=\"color: red\">red text</span>.</p><p>Line one<br>line two</p><p>:::note this is not an admonition</p><h2>Callouts</h2><div data-block-type=\"callout-component\" data-logo-in-use=\"emoji\" data-emoji-unicode=\"128161\" data-emoji-url=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/emoji-datasource-apple/img/apple/64/1f4a1.png\" data-background=\"peach\" data-id=\"c1\"><p>Peach callout with <strong>bold</strong>.</p></div><div data-block-type=\"callout-component\" data-logo-in-use=\"icon\" data-icon-name=\"Info\" data-icon-color=\"#6d7b8a\" data-background=\"green\"><p>Green icon callout.</p></div><h2>Tasks</h2><ul data-type=\"taskList\" class=\"not-prose pl-2 space-y-2\"><li data-type=\"taskItem\" data-checked=\"true\"><label><input type=\"checkbox\" checked=\"checked\"><span></span></label><div><p>Done</p></div></li><li data-type=\"taskItem\" data-checked=\"false\"><label><input type=\"checkbox\"><span></span></label><div><p>Todo</p><ul data-type=\"taskList\"><li data-type=\"taskItem\" data-checked=\"false\"><label><input type=\"checkbox\"><span></span></label><div><p>Nested todo</p></div></li></ul></div></li></ul><h2>Tables</h2><table><tbody><tr><th colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"150\" style=\"background-color: none;\"><p>Key</p></th><th colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"150\"><p>Value</p></th></tr><tr><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" style=\"background-color: null; color: null;\"><p>a | b</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" style=\"background-color: null; color: null;\"><p>c</p></td></tr></tbody></table><table><tbody><tr><th colspan=\"2\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"150,150\" style=\"background-color: null;\"><p>Merged header</p></th></tr><tr><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" style=\"background-color: #fde68a; color: null;\"><p>left</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" style=\"background-color: null; color: null;\"><p>right</p><p>second paragraph</p></td></tr></tbody></table><h2>Code</h2><pre data-id=\"p1\"><code class=\"language-ts\">const value = { a: 1 };\nif (value.a &lt; 2) console.log(\"&lt;ok&gt;\");</code></pre><h2>Media and references</h2><image-component src=\"aaaaaaaa-0000-4000-8000-000000000001\" id=\"blk1\" width=\"420px\" height=\"236px\" aspectratio=\"1.77\" alignment=\"center\" status=\"uploaded\"></image-component><p>Owner: <mention-component id=\"m1\" entity_identifier=\"bbbbbbbb-0000-4000-8000-000000000001\" entity_name=\"user_mention\"></mention-component></p><issue-embed-component entity_identifier=\"dddddddd-0000-4000-8000-000000000001\" project_identifier=\"ENG\" workspace_identifier=\"acme\" id=\"e1\" entity_name=\"issue\"></issue-embed-component><div class=\"py-4 border-strong-1\" data-type=\"horizontalRule\" data-id=\"hr1\"><div></div></div><p>See <a href=\"https://plane.example.com/acme/wiki/00000003-0000-4000-8000-000000000003\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" class=\"text-accent-secondary underline\">Onboarding</a> and <a href=\"/acme/wiki/00000004-0000-4000-8000-000000000004\">Runbooks</a>.</p>",
